## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## SIRI ⇄ Transmodel Alignment
## -----------------------------------------------------------------
## ROLE: Curated conceptual alignment between the generated SIRI base
##       ontology and the Transmodel conceptual model. This is NOT
##       derived from the XSD — it is an editorial mapping overlay.
##
## Mechanism: skos:exactMatch / skos:closeMatch / skos:broadMatch on
##            generated siri: classes → Transmodel concept URIs. SIRI
##            keeps its own identity and naming; Transmodel governs
##            alignment only, without creating hard owl:imports
##            dependencies. Transmodel ontology: https://w3id.org/transmodel/
##
## Loaded alongside the generated SIRI base ontology.
## -----------------------------------------------------------------

@prefix siri:        <https://siri-cen.eu/ontology#> .
@prefix rdfs:        <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl:         <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix skos:        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix tm-journeys: <https://w3id.org/transmodel/journeys#> .
@prefix tm-fac:      <https://w3id.org/transmodel/facilities#> .

<https://siri-cen.eu/alignment/transmodel> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "SIRI–Transmodel Alignment" ;
    owl:imports <https://siri-cen.eu/ontology> ;
    rdfs:comment "Editorial skos alignment from generated SIRI classes to Transmodel concepts." .

## --- Real-time journey views ---

siri:EstimatedVehicleJourney skos:closeMatch tm-journeys:MonitoredVehicleJourney ;
    rdfs:seeAlso tm-journeys:VehicleJourney .

siri:MonitoredVehicleJourneyStructure skos:closeMatch tm-journeys:MonitoredVehicleJourney ;
    rdfs:seeAlso tm-journeys:VehicleJourney .

## --- Accessibility ---

siri:AccessibilityAssessmentStructure skos:exactMatch tm-fac:AccessibilityAssessment .
siri:AccessibilityLimitationStructure skos:exactMatch tm-fac:AccessibilityLimitation .

## --- Facilities ---

siri:FacilityStructure skos:broadMatch tm-fac:Facility .
siri:FacilityCondition skos:closeMatch tm-fac:StatusOfEquipment .

## --- Situations / Validity ---

siri:HalfOpenTimestampOutputRangeStructure skos:closeMatch tm-fac:ValidityCondition .

## --- Stop infrastructure ---

siri:AffectedStopPlaceStructure skos:closeMatch tm-fac:StopPlace .
siri:AffectedStopPointStructure skos:closeMatch tm-journeys:ScheduledStopPoint .
